It is test-only. It imports nothing but the standard library, only
internal/ui's conformance test imports it, and internal/api's
TestConformanceCopyStaysOutOfTheBinary fails if `go list -deps ./cmd/den`
ever lists it. TestConformanceCopyIsPinned checks every hash above.
